  "_about": "Heritage cluster: an F80 M3 (2015), generated by tools/gen_dials.py (edit that and regenerate), always in km/h and C (\"units\": \"metric\"). Two big dials side by side with chrome rings open at the bottom, grey faces, white ticks and numerals, thin red needles on dark hubs: the speed (linear 0-280) and the revs (0-7, a red block from the Redline setting, the M stripe and ENGINE ON / OFF in its face). Small fuel (0 1/2 1) and oil (70 120 170) gauges outboard. Between the dials at the bottom the speed, the gear (red at the shift point) and the drive mode. A status pill in the speedo (green ALL SYSTEMS OK, amber or red with the reason), a trip computer under the fuel gauge, the hybrid battery, electric range, water and the date under the oil gauge. Widget reference: shared/hud.js.",
